  "accuracy_notes": "Dimensions and statistics are measured from the delivered GLB. The 1m clear tread sits inside a 1.32m casing. The 6m footprint includes short landings and two flush treads per terminal; risers open and close gradually. The compact central incline measures approximately 43.7 degrees. Continuous raised skirts enclose step side envelopes; actual surface and casing checks are recorded in reports/assets.json. Blue-green glass uses closed alpha-blended geometry with backface culling and no transmission pass. Source parts may intersect at assembled joints. This static visual study has no hidden circulation mechanism, collider, passenger logic or engineering certification. Full mall integration, aggregate 200 draw-call budget, physical mobile devices and WebKit are not verified.",
